{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"main_base_l6","model_identifier":"main_base_l6","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# main_base_l6\n\nMain base level 6, Keep: a square stone tower in the middle with a small mage balcony (mages train from here), hall wings either side.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with the same layout and much more detail: the keep gains quoins, string courses, machicolation corbels, four corner bartizans with slate spires, lit shuttered windows, a stone-framed studded door, a rooftop flag, braziers and a bell, and violet crystals and runes on the mage balcony; the wings get half-timbered upper floors with dormers, flower boxes and tall brick chimneys; the yard gets a gate with pillars, cobble paths, torch posts, training gear, a well, a hay cart, gardens, bee skeps and a laundry line.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 14 columns (224 x 224 units, 6.30 x 6.30 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -112..112, y -2..253, z -112..112 units.\n- Texture: 1024 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 1414, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- keep: 88 x 234 x 88 (w x h x d) centred at the origin\n- wings: two 64 x 160 x 96 boxes centred at x -72 / +72, z 6\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -51)\n- `slot_balcony` at (0, 153, -50)\n- `slot_parapet_1` at (-18, 223, -36)\n- `slot_parapet_2` at (18, 223, -36)\n- `slot_parapet_3` at (36, 223, -18)\n- `slot_parapet_4` at (36, 223, 18)\n- `slot_parapet_5` at (18, 223, 36)\n- `slot_parapet_6` at (-18, 223, 36)\n- `slot_parapet_7` at (-36, 223, 18)\n- `slot_parapet_8` at (-36, 223, -18)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-96, 175, 6)\n- `fx_smoke_2` at (96, 175, 6)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (30, 0, -60)\n- `fx_fire_1` at (-24, 239, -22)\n- `fx_fire_2` at (24, 239, -22)\n- `fx_fire_torch_1` at (-18, 24, -100)\n- `fx_fire_torch_2` at (18, 24, -100)\n- `fx_fire_torch_3` at (-18, 24, -80)\n- `fx_fire_torch_4` at (18, 24, -80)\n- `fx_fire_torch_5` at (-18, 24, -66)\n- `fx_fire_torch_6` at (18, 24, -66)\n- `fx_window_1` at (0, 165.5, -43.6)\n- `fx_window_2` at (-82, 45, -41.5)\n- `fx_window_3` at (-62, 45, -41.5)\n- `fx_window_4` at (-82, 45, 53.5)\n- `fx_window_5` at (-62, 45, 53.5)\n- `fx_window_6` at (-103.5, 45, -17)\n- `fx_window_7` at (-103.5, 45, 29)\n- `fx_window_8` at (62, 45, -41.5)\n- `fx_window_9` at (82, 45, -41.5)\n- `fx_window_10` at (62, 45, 53.5)\n- `fx_window_11` at (82, 45, 53.5)\n- `fx_window_12` at (103.5, 45, -17)\n- `fx_window_13` at (103.5, 45, 29)\n- `fx_window_14` at (-20, 107, -43.5)\n- `fx_window_15` at (-27, 135, -43.5)\n- `fx_window_16` at (-29, 42, -43.5)\n- `fx_window_17` at (20, 107, -43.5)\n- `fx_window_18` at (27, 135, -43.5)\n- `fx_window_19` at (29, 42, -43.5)\n- `fx_window_20` at (-20, 107, 43.5)\n- `fx_window_21` at (-27, 135, 43.5)\n- `fx_window_22` at (-29, 42, 43.5)\n- `fx_window_23` at (20, 107, 43.5)\n- `fx_window_24` at (27, 135, 43.5)\n- `fx_window_25` at (29, 42, 43.5)\n- `fx_window_26` at (-43.5, 172, 0)\n- `fx_window_27` at (43.5, 172, 0)\n- `fx_window_28` at (-52.5, 217, -44)\n- `fx_window_29` at (-44, 217, -52.5)\n- `fx_window_30` at (-52.5, 217, 44)\n- `fx_window_31` at (-44, 217, 52.5)\n- `fx_window_32` at (52.5, 217, -44)\n- `fx_window_33` at (44, 217, -52.5)\n- `fx_window_34` at (52.5, 217, 44)\n- `fx_window_35` at (44, 217, 52.5)\n- `fx_window_36` at (-10.5, 231.5, 15)\n- `fx_window_37` at (10.5, 231.5, 15)\n- `fx_window_38` at (64.5, 94, -41.5)\n- `fx_window_39` at (79.5, 94, -41.5)\n- `fx_window_40` at (64.5, 94, 53.5)\n- `fx_window_41` at (79.5, 94, 53.5)\n- `fx_window_42` at (